Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `k` was made with `:`, so it can't change
  --> tests/ui/iter_family_mutable_key.jet:7:9
    |
  7 |         k = "z"
    |         ^
 Why: Only `:=` bindings and parameters declared with the write mark `&` can be changed
 Fix: Declare it with `k := ...` instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111

Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `n` was made with `:`, so it can't change
  --> tests/ui/iter_family_mutable_key.jet:14:9
    |
 14 |         n += 10
    |         ^
 Why: Only `:=` bindings and parameters declared with the write mark `&` can be changed
 Fix: Declare it with `n := ...` instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
